   "source": "# ATC Class (L2) × GlycoEnzOnto Pathway Enrichment Analysis (GSEA)\n\nPerform GSEA on GlycoEnzOnto pathways for gene expression profiles of each ATC class (L2 level: 3 characters).\n\n**ATC Level Differences:**\n- L1 (1 character): L = antineoplastic agents in general → too coarse, lacks specificity (09b)\n- **L2 (3 characters)**: L01 = antineoplastic agents, L04 = immunosuppressants → more specific (this notebook)\n- L3 (4 characters): L01D = cytotoxic antibiotics → insufficient sample size\n\n## Analysis Workflow\n1. Retrieve data from Snowflake\n2. Obtain ATC codes (using cache)\n3. Calculate gene scores for each ATC class (**L2 level**)\n4. GSEA pathway enrichment\n5. Visualization (NES dot plot)"
  },
